@model tahsinERP.ViewModels.JobDescEditViewModel
@* JobDesc Create va Edit uchun umumiy forma (HRM-D13). ViewBag.IsEdit = true — tahrirlash. Skriptlar: _FormScripts.cshtml *@
@{
    bool isEdit = ViewBag.IsEdit == true;
}
    <div class="app-content content">
        <div class="content-overlay"></div>
        <div class="content-wrapper">
            <div class="content-header row">
                <div class="content-header-left col-12 mb-2 mt-1">
                    <div class="row breadcrumbs-top">
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <div class="breadcrumb-wrapper col-12">
                                <ol class="breadcrumb rounded-pill breadcrumb-divider d-flex align-items-center">
                                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="@(isEdit ? Url.Content("~/AdminPanel") : Url.Content("~/Home"))"><i class="bx bx-home-alt"></i></a></li>
                                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="~/JobDesc">@L.T("Hr_JdTitle")</a></li>
                                    <li class="breadcrumb-item active">@(isEdit ? L.T("Edit") : L.T("Hr_JdNew"))</li>
                                </ol>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="content-body">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                @if (isEdit)
                                {
                                    <h4 class="card-title"><i class="bx bx-edit mr-1"></i>@L.T("Hr_JdEditInfo")</h4>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <h4 class="card-title"><i class="bx bx-plus-circle mr-1"></i>@L.T("Hr_JdNewInfo")</h4>
                                }
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-content">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    @using (Html.BeginForm(isEdit ? "Edit" : "Create", "JobDesc", FormMethod.Post, new { id = "jobDescForm" }))
                                    {
                                        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                        if (isEdit)
                                        {
                                            @Html.HiddenFor(model => model.DocumentID)
                                            @Html.HiddenFor(model => model.NewVersionNo)
                                        }
                                        @Html.ValidationSummary(true, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })

                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <div class="form-group">
                                                    <label for="JobDescriptionCode">@L.T("Hr_JdCode") <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                                    @Html.TextBoxFor(model => model.JobDescriptionCode, new {
                                                        @class = "form-control",
                                                        @placeholder = L.T("Hr_JdCodePh"),
                                                        @required = "required"
                                                    })
                                                    @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.JobDescriptionCode, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                                    @if (!isEdit)
                                                    {
                                                        <small class="form-text text-muted">@L.T("Hr_JdCodeUnique")</small>
                                                    }
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <div class="form-group">
                                                    <label for="JobTitle">@L.T("Hr_JdName")</label>
                                                    @Html.TextBoxFor(model => model.JobTitle, new {
                                                        @class = "form-control",
                                                        @placeholder = L.T("Hr_JdNamePh")
                                                    })
                                                    @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.JobTitle, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="row">
                                            @if (isEdit)
                                            {
                                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                                    <div class="form-group">
                                                        <label>@L.T("Hr_CurrentVersion")</label>
                                                        <input type="text" class="form-control" value="v@(Model.CurrentVersionNo.ToString("F2"))" disabled />
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                                    <div class="form-group">
                                                        <label>@L.T("Hr_NewVersion") <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                                        <input type="text" class="form-control" value="v@(Model.NewVersionNo.ToString("F2"))" disabled />
                                                        <small class="form-text text-muted">@L.T("Hr_JdVersionHint", Model.CurrentVersionNo.ToString("F2"), Model.NewVersionNo.ToString("F2"))</small>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            }
                                            <div class="@(isEdit ? "col-md-4" : "col-md-6")">
                                                <div class="form-group">
                                                    <label for="Department">@L.T("Hr_OrgUnit")</label>
                                                    @Html.TextBoxFor(model => model.Department, new {
                                                        @class = "form-control",
                                                        @placeholder = L.T("Hr_JdDeptPh")
                                                    })
                                                    @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.Department, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <div class="form-group">
                                                    <label for="HRJobDescriptionID">@L.T("Hr_JdLinkHrPosition")</label>
                                                    @Html.DropDownListFor(model => model.HRJobDescriptionID, ViewBag.HRJobDescriptions as SelectList, L.T("SelectPlaceholder"), new { @class = "form-control" })
                                                    @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.HRJobDescriptionID, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="Notes">@L.T("Note")</label>
                                            @Html.TextAreaFor(model => model.Notes, new {
                                                @class = "form-control",
                                                @rows = "3",
                                                @placeholder = L.T("Hr_AdditionalInfoPh")
                                            })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.Notes, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label>@L.T("Hr_JdContent") <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <div class="alert alert-info">
                                                <i class="bx bx-info-circle"></i>
                                                <strong>@L.T("Note"):</strong> @(isEdit ? L.T("Hr_JdEditHintEdit") : L.T("Hr_JdEditHintNew"))
                                            </div>
                                            
                                            <!-- Quill Editor -->
                                            <div id="editor-container" style="height: 600px; border: 1px solid #ddd; margin-top: 10px;">
                                                <!-- Toolbar -->
                                                <div id="quill-toolbar">
                                                    @Html.Partial("~/Views/DocTemplates/_QuillToolbar.cshtml")
                                                    <span class="ql-formats">
                                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="loadCurrentDocxBtn" title="@(isEdit ? L.T("Hr_JdLoadCurrent") : L.T("Hr_JdLoadTemplate"))">
                                                            <i class="bx bx-file"></i> @(isEdit ? L.T("Hr_CurrentVersion") : L.T("Hr_Template"))
                                                        </button>
                                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success" id="loadDocxBtn" title="@L.T("Hr_JdUploadWordFile")">
                                                            <i class="bx bx-upload"></i> @L.T("Hr_JdUploadWord")
                                                        </button>
                                                    </span>
                                                </div>
                                                <!-- Editor -->
                                                <div id="quill-editor" style="height: 550px;"></div>
                                            </div>
                                            
                                            <!-- Hidden field for document content -->
                                            @Html.HiddenFor(model => model.DocumentContent, new { id = "documentContent" })
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="saveBtn">
                                                <i class="bx bx-save"></i> @(isEdit ? L.T("Hr_JdSaveNewVersion") : L.T("Save"))
                                            </button>
                                            <a href="@(isEdit ? Url.Action("Details", "JobDesc", new { id = Model.DocumentID }) : Url.Action("Index", "JobDesc"))" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">
                                                <i class="bx bx-x"></i> @L.T("Cancel")
                                            </a>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quill.js CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.quilljs.com/1.3.6/quill.snow.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        #quill-editor {
            background: white;
        }
        .ql-container {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        #quill-toolbar {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 8px;
        }
        #quill-toolbar .ql-formats {
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        #quill-toolbar button {
            margin: 0 2px;
        }
    </style>
